bookContent1=The adult world is boring, and they are always complaining about us kids. \\nI've heard of a faraway place called Sky Island where the most outstanding children can become the world's creator. \\nIt is a utopia for children, I must find it! \\n
bookContent2=Good morning, Sky Island. I'm standing here on the edge of the island watching the sun rise, and at this moment, it feels like all the hardships from the journey were worth it. \\nYes, they were right... You are the Utopia for children, and the land of adventures that every warrior wants to conquer. \\n
bookContent3=Oh, such an annoying but fascinating Sky Island! It is really tough to survive here.\\nIt seems that I need to hand-down some skills for others.\\nHey newbies, two important tips for you: \\n1, Click all the buttons and clickable pictures to better explore and understand this land. \\n2, Change the walking mode to sneak mode to ensure that you will not fall while building. \\n
bookContent4=Hey, I think you've noticed that there are a lot of floating islands around. \\nThere are gifts left on those islands by the pioneer adventurers, including from me. \\nGo get them! Expand your island with blocks. By the way, you can get blocks from your miner machine and in the Mining Zone. \\n
bookContent5=Time flies so fast, I have been here for two years. I met many friends here. \\nSome of them are old castle fanatics, and they took me to visit their castles and islands. \\nSome of them are fighting enthusiasts, who took me to the Mining Zone to fight with dragons. \\nThis is a world filled with all kinds of magnificent fantasies...\\nYeah, I've fallen in love with this place! I will stay. \\n
bookContent6=Good mornning, there's a lot to look forward to today! \\nOld Jack taught me a few tricks yesterday, and I'm going to try them today. Why don't you join me? \\n1. You can plow earth or grass blocks with a hoe, then plant all sorts of seeds on them. \\n2. If you scatter bone powder on earth blocks, all sorts of flowers will grow on them and you can use those flowers to make dyes at the crafting table. \\n3. If you place two water in a 3 x 1 hole, it will become a source of unlimited water. You can also do this by placing water at opposite corners of a 2 x 2 whole.
bookContent7=Hey, the world will change every two weeks. \\nI've witnessed how this impefect world improves over time. \\nBelieve in it, and with time and patience, you will be rewarded with its beauty and miracles. \\n
bookContent8=Good morning, my friends. \\nI haven't seen your island since we met. \\nIf there is a chance, would you like to show it in another world and let everyone see it? \\nI really want everyone to see it. Don't be shy. You have worked so hard, and it must be as perfect as it can be.\\n

