Item_Name570005=Thank you for your interest and support for "Sky Block". <Discord：https://discord.com/invite/bgskyblock>\\n【2026/11/20 update content】\\n\\n1.To celebrate Blockmango's 9th anniversary, Skyblock is launching the following celebration activities:\\n(1) Players can complete anniversary quests to earn 9th Anniversary Tokens;\\n(2) Use the tokens to participate in the Anniversary Draw for a chance to obtain the 9th Anniversary themed set;\\n(3) Players can also complete GCube consumption quests daily to gain Anniversary Wheel draw chances, with a chance to obtain gifts such as Bat Eggs;\\n(4) By participating in the above activities, players all have a chance to earn Anniversary Points and join the Anniversary Leaderboard. When the leaderboard is settled, a large number of rewards will be distributed, and the first-place player can also get the chance to display their own character model in Skyblock!\\nFor detailed event rules, please visit the 9th Anniversary event page.\\n\\n2.Survival Mode has launched an alliance feature. In Survival Mode, players can now create or join an alliance from the social list. After successfully forming an alliance, players become teammates, teammates will not deal damage to each other, and the beacon territory range of allied players will turn blue. More features can be experienced by visiting in person!\\n\\nFor more follow-up activities and the latest news, please pay attention to the official website forum or the official Discord forum <https://discord.com/invite/bgskyblock>.
