gui.mine.main.task.desc3101101=Welcome to the mining area, adventurer. This place is full of dangers, but it is also full of wealth and equipment. I will help you master the ability to survive in the mining area. This is a meeting gift, please accept it~
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101102=Select a weapon in the shortcut bar to increase your damage. Kill the ghost wandering at the door and I will give you a stronger sword.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101103=I heard someone crying not far away, it seemed like someone was trapped by a monster, use your new weapon, defeat the surrounding monsters and help her get home
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101104=Thanks for your help, I gave you some stronger armor. Wear it in your backpack and try to kill the ghost at the door!
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101105=Wait a minute, I feel strange energy from those ghost. Can you help me collect the materials they dropped? This may be a clue to building powerful equipment.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101106=The materials have been transported back to the Adventurer's Guild for analysis, and it will take some time to get the results. There is a master in the mine, and he seems to have something to tell you.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101107=First time mining? Select the pickaxe tool in the shortcut bar, which can greatly improve your mining efficiency. Go and give it a try.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101108=Only by knowing minerals can you know their value. Selling mineral materials is also a good way to make money. Start simple, dig some coal for me first, and I will give you a better pickaxe.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101109=This is a new pickaxe for you. It can greatly increase your mining speed. Use the new pickaxe to go to the mining area and experience it.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101110=Have you discovered it? Mining the golden ore in the mine can drop gold ingots, which can be synthesized into props or sold directly to make money.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101111=When you dig blue ores, you can drop crystal diamonds. Not only can you synthesize diamond tools, but you can also synthesize diamond-quality swords. Bring the diamonds back to me, and this stronger sword will be yours.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101112=Better swords do more damage. Put the Diamond Sword in your hotbar and use your new sword to defeat these monsters.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101113=During the adventure, you will pick up a variety of props. You can sell the miscellaneous items for gold coins. Use the [Bulk Sell] button in the backpack and it will automatically help you choose props suitable for sale. Of course, you can also Manually select the items you want to sell”
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101114=The blacksmith next door said that he accidentally left his hammer behind while exploring the tomb. Can you go to the depths of the tomb to help him retrieve the hammer?"
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101115=It seems that the blacksmith has given you diamond-quality armor. Wearing them in your backpack can improve your defense. Wear diamond armor to defeat higher-level monsters. I will reward you with the remaining two diamond-level defenses. 
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101116=Wait a minute, I also feel the same strange energy from those zombies. Can you please bring back their research samples?
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101117=The materials have been transported back to the Adventurer's Guild for analysis. It will take some time to get the results. It seems that the mining master has something to say to you again.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101118=The results of the investigation are out. Monster materials combined with specific ores can make stronger weapons and armor. We still need the last specific ore!
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101119=Use the materials you found and go to the iron felt to forge a new weapon. It will be bigger, stronger, and more damaging than diamond-level weapons!
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101120=In order to ensure the safety around the camp, use your new sword to clean up the wandering zombies
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101121=I heard that there is a more powerful monster deep in the faded tomb. Obtain the materials from it to create armor and equipment with higher defense and more health points.\\n *The BOSS is more difficult and recommended. people go to fight together
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101122=The portal has changed after the BOSS is defeated. You can use the large portal in front to lead to new areas. Don't worry, you can use our fast travel function to return here for free.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101123=Adventurer, for the sake of safety around the camp, please clean up the monsters nearby.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101124=I heard the cry of a boy not far away. Is he the one brought here by the portal? Please defeat the monsters around him and help him go home.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101125=There are too many monsters here. In order to prevent more people from being harmed, please kill more slimes.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101126=Wait a minute, the items dropped by these lava slimes can also be used to create super armor. Can you please collect more?
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101127=Oh, by the way, the Ore Master also came here through the portal. He is in the mine not far behind you. You should also go and see him. Maybe the ore here will be helpful to you.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101128=New ore, it looks like it can be sold at a higher price
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101129=In order to build our temporary camp in this volcanic area, we need some iron ingots. Can you please bring them back?
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101130=Thank you very much. The Ore Master seems to have made a new discovery. Go talk to him quickly.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101131=He said that these special ores are also necessary materials for making advanced equipment. After collecting some lava ingots, you can use the iron felt next to it to view the equipment formula.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101132=In order to build our temporary camp, we need some diamonds. Can you please bring them back? I will give you some useful information.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101133=We sent an investigator. He went to find the location of the BOSS. Now he seems to have found something. Go talk to him.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101134=It seems that you already know the location of the BOSS. If you kill these monsters, we will recognize your ability to challenge the BOSS.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101135=The mission to kill the lava golem has been released. Adventurers, please confirm the armor and weapons on your body before heading to the depths of the volcano. \\n *The BOSS is more difficult. It is recommended that multiple people fight together.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101136=The portal has changed after the BOSS is defeated. You can use the small portal next to it to lead to a new area. Don't worry, you can use our fast travel function to return here for free.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101137=This place has been occupied by cursed slimes. Please clear an area as our temporary camp.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101138=I heard the cry of a boy not far away. Is he the one brought here by the portal? Please defeat the monsters around him and help him go home.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101139=The monsters around here seem to be stronger. Adventurer, for the safety of the camp, please defeat more monsters.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101140=These cursed slimes also contain materials that can be used to make super strong armor. Collect more materials to build equipment.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101141=The investigator we sent went to investigate the monsters in this area. Ask him what he found.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101142=Skeleton monsters, they seem to have materials that can be used to make equipment. Kill more skeletons and see.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101143=The ribs of the skeleton are another new material. Collect more to build stronger armor. You can use the iron felt next to it to view the armor synthesis formula.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101144=Our old friend also came here, and he was detecting rocks next to the camp.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101145=New ore, it looks like it can be sold at a higher price
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101146=In order to build our temporary camp in this cursed garden, we need some gold ingots. Can you please bring them back?
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101147=Thank you very much. The Ore Master seems to have made a new discovery. Go talk to him quickly.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101148=He said that these cursed ores are also necessary materials for making high-level equipment. After collecting some cursed ingots, you can use the iron felt next to it to view the formula of the equipment.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101149=In order to build our temporary camp, we need some emeralds. Can you please bring them back? I will give you some useful information.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101150=Our investigator, he seems to have found the location of the BOSS. Go talk to him quickly.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101151=The BOSS here is more powerful than what you have encountered before. Improve your strength. After defeating these monsters, we will issue a BOSS killing mission for you.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101152=The mission to kill the Skull Samurai has been released. Adventurers, please confirm the armor and weapons on your body before heading inside the courtyard.\\n *The BOSS is more difficult, so it is recommended that multiple people fight together.
gui.mine.main.task.desc3101153=The Skull Samurai was defeated, but it seems that a new portal was created as a result. Can you please go deep into the courtyard to investigate the new portal?
gui.mine.main.task.talk01=[QwQ]Thank you very much, I will go back to a safe place now
gui.mine.main.task.talk02=Ore is money! Come and mine too, my friend
gui.mine.main.task.talk03=You found the lost hammer
gui.mine.main.task.talk04=Special ores that can be used in the recipes of armor and weapons.
gui.mine.main.task.talk05=[QwQ]Thank you very much, I will go back to a safe place now
gui.mine.main.task.talk06=Hell Stone is a common rock in hell. Why is it here in the volcano?
gui.mine.main.task.talk07=Lava ingots are a necessary material for making Molten Core armor sets
gui.mine.main.task.talk08=The lava golem's lair is ahead. If it is driven into the lava, it will cause fatal injuries.
gui.mine.main.task.talk09=[QwQ]Thank you very much, I will go back to a safe place now
gui.mine.main.task.talk10=We discovered that in addition to the cursed slimes, there is also a monster called a skeleton wandering here.
gui.mine.main.task.talk11=There are Doom Stone everywhere here. You can dig them up and sell them for money, or move them back to your home.
gui.mine.main.task.talk12=Curse ingot is a necessary material for making cursed samurai armor sets
gui.mine.main.task.talk13=Ahead is the courtyard of the Skeleton Samurai. It is very powerful and will also release black cursed tornadoes.
gui.mine.main.task.talk14=You did a great job, there are still two left, and I will gain the most powerful power!
