gui.create.team.intro.g1066=1. Move to 5 designated areas on the battlefield map, approach the flag, defeat enemy players within the flag's radius, raise the flag to the top, and claim it with your team's color\\n\\n2. Each flag provides 10 Victory Points per second to your team. The more flags controlled, the higher the points gained per second. The first team to reach 15,00 points wins\\n\\n3. Upon death, you may select to respawn near any flag currently controlled by your team on the map\\n\\n4. After the match, Flag Coins will be awarded based on your in-game ranking. If your team wins, you receive an additional bonus amount
gui.create.team.intro.g1066hide=1. In the Hide and Seek map, take turns playing as the Hider and the Searcher. Based on in-game performance, points will be tallied after 5 rounds, and Hide and Seek Tickets will be distributed.\\n2. The Hider must hide within the map. Not being caught before the round timer ends results in victory. Surviving for every 60s grants 1 point reward.\\n3. The Searcher must find all Hiders hidden in the map before the round timer ends. Catching 1 Hider grants 1 point reward.\\n4. A caught Hider will be transformed into a Searcher and continue playing, but cannot earn the round victory points for the Searcher role.
gui.create.team.intro.g1066scape=1. You can form a team of 4 with your friends or other random players to enter the game. Up to 40 players can play at the same time on a large map of 500x550.\\n2. In escape mode, you can only bring the armor you are wearing and the items on the shortcut bar into the game for use (actions in escape mode will not consume your props)\\n3. In the escape mode, you will have an exclusive backpack, collect high-value props as much as possible, find your team's escape point, and leave with the supplies in exchange for a large number of event coins! Escape Mode Coins can be used as a pre-game investment for the next round of play, or to enter event draws for free!\\n4. Before the escape mode starts, you can purchase props in advance to strengthen your abilities through the gain store in the upper left corner of the screen (the purchased props are only effective in one round of the game, but you can resell them after successfully escaping!)\\n5. If you die in escape mode, all the props you obtained in this mode will be dropped!
