g1048_event_desert_survival_desc=1. You can form a team of 4 with your friends or other random players to enter the game. Up to 40 players can play at the same time on a large map of 500x550.\\n2. In escape mode, you can only bring the armor you are wearing and the items on the shortcut bar into the game for use (actions in escape mode will not consume your props)\\n3. In the escape mode, you will have an exclusive backpack, collect high-value props as much as possible, find your team's escape point, and leave with the supplies in exchange for a large number of event coins! Escape Mode Coins can be used as a pre-game investment for the next round of play, or to enter event draws for free!\\n4. Before the escape mode starts, you can purchase props in advance to strengthen your abilities through the gain store in the upper left corner of the screen (the purchased props are only effective in one round of the game, but you can resell them after successfully escaping!)\\n5. If you die in escape mode, all the props you obtained in this mode will be dropped!
