set_bonus_621=(5/5)Gain 1 stack of Scorpion Venom Counter on attack/hit. Max 6 stacks. When maxed, the next attack deals an additional 10 Magic Damage and inflicts Wound for 3 seconds.
set_bonus_721=(2/4)When your own MAX ♥HP ≥ 110,⊙DEF +1
set_bonus_821=(4/4)Gain 1 stack of Scorpion Venom Counter on attack/hit. Max 5 stacks. When maxed, the next attack deals an additional 15 Magic Damage and inflicts Wound for 3 seconds.
weapon_ability_1420=Lifesteal +8%\\nOn melee attack, 30% chance to summon the Lion King. Each attack triggers a coordinated attack from the Lion King. The Lion King inherits 40% of the master's ATK, as well as all CRI Rate, CRI DMG, and Lifesteal attributes (the Lion King's Lifesteal restores HP for the master). When taking damage, the Lion King absorbs 25% of the damage, up to 20 HP, lasting 3s.
weapon_ability_1421=Lifesteal +8%\\nOn melee attack, 30% chance to summon the Lion King. Each attack triggers a coordinated attack from the Lion King. The Lion King inherits 40% of the master's ATK, as well as all CRI Rate, CRI DMG, and Lifesteal attributes (the Lion King's Lifesteal restores HP for the master). When taking damage, the Lion King absorbs 25% of the damage, up to 20 HP, lasting 3s.
set_bonus_620=(5/5) Gain 1 Momentum when hit or when an attack hits, and 2 Momentum on a critical hit (max 10). When Momentum ≤5, each point blocks 0.3 damage for you; when Momentum >5, each point grants 3% CRI Rate; when Momentum is full, clear all Momentum and enter Berserk state, becoming immune to all control effects and gaining 30% CRI Rate and 20% Lifesteal for 2s.
set_bonus_720=(2/4) When you have MAX ♥ Health ≥140, gain 12% Damage Reduction.
set_bonus_820=(4/4) Gain 1 Momentum when hit or when an attack hits, and 2 Momentum on a critical hit (max 10). When Momentum ≤5, each point blocks 0.5 damage for you; when Momentum >5, each point grants 4% CRI Rate; when Momentum is full, clear all Momentum and enter Berserk state, becoming immune to all control effects and gaining 50% CRI Rate and 50% Lifesteal for 2s.
buff_579=After each attack hit, gain 3% CRI Rate (stacks up to 6 times), lasting 3 seconds; when taking damage, there is a 50% chance to lose 1 stack.
